nd help you rebuild Moria, while you embark on Expeditions to uncover even greater treasures and long-buried secrets\u2026", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-lord-of-the-rings-return-to-moria-durins-folk-expansion", "videos": [{"id": 165813, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "dR3nlac_v90", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dR3nlac_v90", "title": "The Lord of the Rings: Return to Moria\u2122 - Durin's Folk - SDCC Exclusive", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dR3nlac_v90/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165815, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "bpO6AuqqmTw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bpO6AuqqmTw", "title": "Forge Talk 12: Durin's Folk Discussions", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bpO6AuqqmTw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165812, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "i16nD1GAZ8s", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i16nD1GAZ8s", "title": "The Lord of the Rings: Return to Moria\u2122 - Durin's Folk: Release Date Announcement", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/i16nD1GAZ8s/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165814, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "Vz2R6xxNQI0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vz2R6xxNQI0", "title": "Forge Talk 11: SDCC Round Up & More", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Vz2R6xxNQI0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 168538, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "wCBN_yN2lyg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wCBN_yN2lyg", "title": "The Lord of the Rings: Return to Moria\u2122 - Durin's Folk Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wCBN_yN2lyg/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}